  "bio": "MissD is an exceptional tattoo artist based in London, known for her delicate and elegant touch in minimalist, fineline, black & gray, and floral styles. Her impeccable attention to cleanliness ensures a safe, sterile environment for each individual client, mirroring the meticulous nature of her art. Clients frequently commend the professionalism with which MissD conducts her sessions, marking her as a trusted artist in the United Kingdom's tattoo community.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: London, England, United Kingdom\n\n⚜️ 𝘉𝘰𝘰𝘬𝘪𝘯𝘨𝘴 𝙾𝚗𝚕𝚢 - 𝘞𝘩𝘢𝘵𝘴𝘈𝘱𝘱 \n 📩 07481959454\n🚫ɴᴏ ʜᴀɴᴅꜱ/ꜰɪɴɢᴇʀꜱ/ꜰᴇᴇᴛ ᴛᴀᴛᴛᴏᴏꜱ\n⚜️𝘐𝘭𝘭𝘶𝘴𝘵𝘳𝘢𝘵𝘪𝘷𝘦•𝘊𝘰𝘷𝘦𝘳 𝘶𝘱𝘴•𝘎𝘰𝘵𝘩𝘪𝘤•𝘍𝘭𝘰𝘳𝘢𝘭𝘴\n⚜️𝘛𝘶𝘦-𝘍𝘳𝘪 • 11𝘢𝘮\n⚜️ꜱᴀᴛᴜʀᴅᴀʏꜱ ʙᴏᴏᴋᴇᴅ",
